{"ID":"20240519170253-5al5zmr","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240519170253-5al5zmr","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240519170253-5al5zmr\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240519170253-ygu3ywq\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240520081349-terfrlq\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240520081349-terfrlq\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:40,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:53\u0026#125;","title":"長壽秘訣","type":"doc","updated":"20240520081417"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240519170253-ygu3ywq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519170253-ygu3ywq","updated":"20240520081342"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"自古以來上至帝王下至平民百姓 \"\u003e"}]},{"ID":"20240520081342-2q4pdyv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240520081342-2q4pdyv","updated":"20240520081345"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"長壽的秘訣"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240520081349-sfka9hx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240520081349-sfka9hx","updated":"20240520081349"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"自古以來上至帝王下至平民百姓 , 人人都在追求長壽的方法 , 但是似乎都不盡人願 , 其實真正的長壽秘密其實就在我們身邊 , 我們不知道而已 , 一直被西醫誤導到錯誤的方向 ."}]},{"ID":"20240520081349-o7mgi01","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240520081349-o7mgi01","updated":"20240520081349"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"      2001年8月26日美國新聞報導 , 有一百歲人瑞女性 , 身體非常健康 , 而且其兄弟姊妹也一樣長壽 , 記者問她為何如此健康 ? 她的答案非常有趣 , 摘錄如下 :"}]},{"ID":"20240520081359-y0lsf1l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240520081359-y0lsf1l","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\t1.她每天抽一包煙 , 80年來未間斷過 ."}]},{"ID":"20240520081349-cxgbu8g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240520081349-cxgbu8g","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);","updated":"20240520081404"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"        2.她從不聽她的醫生建議 , 想吃什麼就吃什麼 , 從不按時睡覺 , 想睡就睡 , 一日也不喝八大杯水 ."}]},{"ID":"20240520081349-xbv3t6n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240520081349-xbv3t6n","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);","updated":"20240520081405"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"        3.從不吃西藥 , 拒絕任何西藥合成的營養劑 ."}]},{"ID":"20240520081349-k3wrvfx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240520081349-k3wrvfx","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);","updated":"20240520081406"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"        4.最喜歡與家人一起跳舞唱歌 , 每天開開心心 , 從不去羨慕妒嫉別人 , 從不與人計較 ."}]},{"ID":"20240520081349-73tmk6b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240520081349-73tmk6b","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);","updated":"20240520081407"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"        5.每天走路是最喜歡的運動 , 從不去健身中心 ."}]},{"ID":"20240520081349-qbn9pto","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240520081349-qbn9pto","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);","updated":"20240520081408"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"        6.從未去健康檢查 , 因為不相信醫生說的 ."}]},{"ID":"20240520081349-yib7rtn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240520081349-yib7rtn","updated":"20240520081349"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"      西醫為了自圓其說 , 解釋為其人有長壽基因而造成的 , 企圖轉移目標注意力 , 並且提高自己的身價 , 實在是不要臉 , 此人瑞已經說明的很清楚了 , 她為何長壽 , 但西醫卻聽而不見 , 可見其心虛如此 , 而事實証明她活得比世上所有西醫的壽命都長而且更快樂."}]},{"ID":"20240520081349-terfrlq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240520081349-terfrlq","updated":"20240520081417"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"      我們每個人都有長壽的基因 , 老天爺絕對是公平的 , 但是很多人因為"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"濫用西藥及過量服用營養藥物"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" , 故而破壞此一系統 , 造成人類短命 , 西醫隱瞞此一事實 , 永遠不承認是自他們造成的 , 反而想去發現人類基因密碼 , 口口聲聲用發現二字 , 實際上億萬年前此基因已經存在 , 並非他們發現的 , 此基因控制著生態的平衡 , 任何人要去改變它 , 必然給人類帶來無可彌補的災難 . 能夠了解我的說明的人必然佔少數 , 畢竟世界上智慧的人較少 , 愚昧無知的人佔多數 ."}]}]}